# Amazon reports contain buyer names, addresses and phone numbers. Amazon's Data
# Protection Policy requires that PII be deleted within 30 days of delivery, and a git
# history is the opposite of deletable - a committed file is there for ever, on every
# clone, in every backup.
#
# Nothing in this directory is committed. The importers read from here and the files are
# deleted afterwards.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
